WEBVTT

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:36.050
When I open my photo book, I see different sides of me. {purichou...}

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:38.820
Laughing, {warattari}

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:41.600
or playing it cool, in all the pictures. {sumashitari de...}

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:44.330
I don't wanna say, "what's with all these characters?" But... {nani kore...}

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:47.040
Isn't this too much fun? {arisugi...}

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:49.620
For real? {maji...}

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:51.830
I mean, thanks! {tte yuu ka...}

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:55.160
Even if I lose my way,  {maigo ni...}

00:00:55.160 --> 00:00:57.770
my heart's egg {kokoro no...}

00:00:57.770 --> 00:01:00.540
will be all right. Come back {daijoubu...}

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:03.230
to me! {modotteoide}

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:06.010
Hey, when we're together... {kimi to...}

00:01:06.010 --> 00:01:08.730
Hop, step, jump!

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:11.340
Because you're here... {kimi ga...}

00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:13.990
Drew, draw, drawn!

00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:16.860
I'm always with you...  {kimi to...}

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:19.580
Chip, syrup, whip!

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:22.260
One more time,  {mou ichido...}

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:24.870
unlock my heart! {kokoro...}

00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:27.640
I love you.  {daisuki yo}

00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:30.100
All of you.  {minna}

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:32.990
I want to be next to you. {soba ni...}

00:01:32.990 --> 00:01:35.300
Okay? {ne...}

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:36.450
Love ya! {suki yo}

00:01:48.470 --> 00:01:51.060
Amu-chan, look at this! It's big news!

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:52.200
Newsh!

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:54.970
Look, this letter from Shu-chan says he's getting married!

00:01:54.970 --> 00:01:56.060
Huh?

00:01:56.060 --> 00:02:00.450
He played with you so much when you were little.

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:02.550
I can't believe he's getting married.

00:02:02.550 --> 00:02:04.040
Who's Shu-chan?

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:05.770
My cousin.

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:08.770
Shu-niichan's

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:10.790
getting married.

00:02:11.830 --> 00:02:16.830
My First Love's Wedding Cake

00:02:11.830 --> 00:02:16.830
Episode 35

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:21.350
Oh, there it is!

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:23.850
That's the hotel.

00:02:24.270 --> 00:02:26.560
We're all staying there tonight!

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:28.630
And then tomorrow is...

00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:30.620
Da wedding!

00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:34.140
Wedding, wedding, big wedding.

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:42.850
Y-You guys are embarrassing me.

00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:45.820
Viva the ceremony of love!

00:02:45.820 --> 00:02:48.760
This will be my first time attending a wedding.

00:02:48.760 --> 00:02:50.430
My heart's kind of racing.

00:02:50.430 --> 00:02:51.060
Yeah!

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:55.290
Hey, Mom, Shu-niichan works at this hotel, right?

00:02:55.290 --> 00:02:56.390
That's right.

00:02:56.390 --> 00:02:58.470
I wonder where he is.

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:01.600
Can I go look for him?

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:07.640
Amu-chan, you seem rather nervous.

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:10.120
Because...

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:12.830
I haven't seen him in a long time.

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:17.540
Fluffy whipped cream, just like a cloud!

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:20.580
The strawberry is like an angel's cheek!

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:33.210
What do you think? Don't they look yummy?

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:36.740
A-A little, I guess.

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:38.430
Go ahead, try one.

00:03:47.140 --> 00:03:49.320
Amu-chan smiled!

00:03:49.320 --> 00:03:52.430
All right! I'm definitely going to become a pâtissier!

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:54.330
Pati-sser?

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:56.440
It's someone who makes cakes.

00:03:56.440 --> 00:04:01.430
Everyone who eats cake makes a happy face, from the littlest girl to the oldest grandma.

00:04:01.430 --> 00:04:06.350
Just one bite makes happiness overflow inside you, like when you fall in love.

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:10.810
I'll be a pâtissier who makes those kinds of cakes.

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:17.800
Might he have been your first love?

00:04:17.800 --> 00:04:19.860
N-No! Not at all!

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:22.220
What else do you expect from the girl of many loves?

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:23.680
Woo-woo!

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:25.850
Hey, Hinamori!

00:04:25.850 --> 00:04:28.850
Kitchen

00:04:25.850 --> 00:04:28.850
What in the world are you doing at a time like this?

00:04:28.850 --> 00:04:31.940
You can't slack off just because it's the day before your wedding!

00:04:31.940 --> 00:04:34.100
You have a mountain of responsibilities!

00:04:34.100 --> 00:04:35.760
Shu-niichan!

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:36.350
What?

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:38.080
I'm sorry!

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:40.860
But I found these wild blueberries!

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:45.060
Yum.

00:04:45.060 --> 00:04:48.440
It tastes like a fresh, juicy drop of sunlight!

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:52.310
I'll use these to make an extraordinary wedding cake!

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:54.300
Good grief.

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:55.930
Before you do that...

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:57.660
Clean the kitchen!

00:04:57.660 --> 00:05:00.300
And when you finish with that, peel a hundred apples!

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:01.140
Yes, Sir!

00:05:01.140 --> 00:05:02.180
All right.

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:06.780
I'm looking forward to seeing your wedding cake.

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:07.740
Yes, Sir!

00:05:08.930 --> 00:05:11.960
All right, let's clean this place up!

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:13.600
Can I help?

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:17.810
Pâtissier-san.

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:20.560
Amu-chan?

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:22.020
No way!

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:23.600
You've grown so much!

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:26.650
It wasn't so long ago that you were a baby just out of diapers!

00:05:26.650 --> 00:05:29.210
Diapers? When was that?

00:05:29.210 --> 00:05:32.040
You've grown into quite the fine girl!

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:36.000
You've grown up, too! You made your dream of becoming a pâtissier come true!

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:37.870
I'm still an apprentice.

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:41.020
I just clean, wash dishes, do prep work.

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:42.730
You're trying hard, though.

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:45.560
Yep, especially for tomorrow's wedding.

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:50.610
My first wedding cake will be for my own wedding.

00:05:50.610 --> 00:05:57.970
One bite of the cake I make will make everyone's hearts overflow with happiness, from my bride to all our guests.

00:06:00.050 --> 00:06:02.450
He hasn't changed a bit.

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:03.470
Nope.

00:06:03.470 --> 00:06:07.650
He really likes to make cakes, doesn't he?

00:06:07.650 --> 00:06:08.520
Huh?

00:06:08.520 --> 00:06:09.890
I could've sworn I just heard a voice.

00:06:09.890 --> 00:06:12.090
Huh? Wh-What are you talking about?

00:06:12.090 --> 00:06:14.140
He can hear us!

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:16.870
Though it looks like he can't see us.

00:06:16.870 --> 00:06:19.560
He must still have his heart's egg!

00:06:20.970 --> 00:06:22.930
That's strange.

00:06:22.930 --> 00:06:26.460
Anyway, what's your bride like?

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:28.670
I heard she's pretty rich.

00:06:30.270 --> 00:06:31.810
Oh, she's

00:06:31.810 --> 00:06:34.270
just like an angel!

00:06:34.270 --> 00:06:36.020
And on top of that, she's totally into me!

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:37.470
Uh-huh.

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:40.520
Is everything okay? Madame Saeki Nobuko once said...

00:06:40.520 --> 00:06:47.850
Every woman feels uncertain before she marries; uncertain about whether this person is really the one!

00:06:49.070 --> 00:06:51.600
In Eriko's case...

00:06:51.600 --> 00:06:52.160
Shoot!

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:54.890
What?

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:57.520
I promised I'd go pick her up!

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:23.080
I'm telling you, I can carry them myself.

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:24.820
You mustn't, Miss.

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:25.650
Jeez.

00:07:25.650 --> 00:07:27.410
What a beauty!

00:07:27.410 --> 00:07:29.640
I hear she's a daughter of the Otomo Cartel.

00:07:29.640 --> 00:07:31.760
The super famous one?

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:35.520
Not only that, she has great style! She's even modeled in fashion magazines!

00:07:35.520 --> 00:07:37.560
That's too amazing!

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:40.020
No way.

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:41.090
Eriko!

00:07:41.090 --> 00:07:41.600
What?

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:44.640
Shu-chan, what's the meaning of this?

00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:46.160
I'm sorry! Really!

00:07:46.160 --> 00:07:47.560
I've been waiting!

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:49.150
Well...

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:52.560
I found the perfect ingredients to use in the wedding cake for tomorrow.

00:07:52.560 --> 00:07:57.560
Didn't I tell you that we have something important to discuss?

00:07:58.850 --> 00:08:02.560
I've been wavering for a while...

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:04.930
There's something that I haven't been able to tell you.

00:08:04.930 --> 00:08:09.940
Oh? Could it be that you were wondering whether I was cheating on you?

00:08:09.940 --> 00:08:11.280
Don't worry!

00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:14.140
I only did it three times!

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:17.100
Cheated on me?

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:18.560
No wait, twice!

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:23.850
What?

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:26.300
Forget it. I hate you!

00:08:29.030 --> 00:08:31.940
Miss, are the preparations for tomorrow complete?

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:33.440
I don't care about that.

00:08:33.440 --> 00:08:36.180
It was just a joke!

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:38.520
You aren't thinking of cancelling the ceremony?

00:08:38.520 --> 00:08:39.720
I told you I don't care!

00:08:39.720 --> 00:08:41.430
Please wait!

00:08:42.150 --> 00:08:44.600
Like an angel?

00:08:47.680 --> 00:08:50.930
Eriko, my regret is deeper than the sea!

00:08:50.930 --> 00:08:53.680
I'm sorry! Sorry! Sorry! Sorry!

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:55.890
Why don't you just call her?

00:08:57.040 --> 00:08:59.410
She must've turned it off.

00:08:59.410 --> 00:09:01.770
I guess she really is angry.

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:04.270
Amu-chan!

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:06.330
We heard! We heard!

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:11.000
Someone said that the famous daughter of the Otomo Cartel is staying at this hotel!

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:12.020
Shtaying!

00:09:12.020 --> 00:09:16.220
And that she might break off her engagement!

00:09:16.220 --> 00:09:17.560
Bweak off!

00:09:18.810 --> 00:09:22.310
We heard that her fiancé is a pathetic novice pâtissier,

00:09:22.310 --> 00:09:24.690
and that she might be totally fed up with him!

00:09:24.690 --> 00:09:26.470
Totawy fed up!

00:09:27.640 --> 00:09:30.120
No, no, no! That's not true!

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:32.310
Well, her fiancé <i>is</i> just an apprentice...

00:09:32.310 --> 00:09:37.220
She'd be much better off not getting married, and continuing to do great things in the modeling world.

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:39.260
I-I'm telling you!

00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:40.660
Pathetic

00:09:38.870 --> 00:09:40.660
Novice

00:09:39.160 --> 00:09:40.660
Fed Up

00:09:40.650 --> 00:09:43.770
Huh? Could you be Shu-chan?

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:46.100
Oh my, it's been so long!

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:48.100
Congratulations on your upcoming wedding!

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:49.970
So where's your bride-to-be?

00:09:49.970 --> 00:09:52.060
Come on, tell us! Where is she?

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:01.060
Did we say something wrong?

00:10:01.060 --> 00:10:02.490
You sure did.

00:10:08.640 --> 00:10:09.500
That jerk.

00:10:12.900 --> 00:10:13.960
Eriko.

00:10:14.610 --> 00:10:15.980
Father.

00:10:24.770 --> 00:10:27.960
I can't believe this. They're suddenly breaking off their engagement?

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:31.530
They mustn't! That would be a catastrophe!

00:10:31.530 --> 00:10:33.310
Amu-chan, over there!

00:10:33.850 --> 00:10:41.480
So you still haven't spoken to Shuji-kun about how your feelings have changed since you got engaged?

00:10:41.480 --> 00:10:42.470
That's correct, Sir.

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:45.450
She seriously changed her mind?

00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:47.720
I'll respect your wishes.

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:52.470
You can make your own choices about your life.

00:10:52.470 --> 00:10:54.190
This is bad!

00:10:54.190 --> 00:10:55.120
Amu-chan!

00:10:55.870 --> 00:10:58.160
I've already decided.

00:10:58.710 --> 00:11:01.150
Shuji-san will probably be surprised.

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:03.630
But...

00:11:03.630 --> 00:11:06.370
I can't deny

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:09.600
my true feelings anymore!

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:12.130
Wh-What should we do?

00:11:30.930 --> 00:11:34.550
I've been wavering for a while...

00:11:34.550 --> 00:11:36.870
There's something that I haven't been able to tell you.

00:11:38.350 --> 00:11:40.720
What was she going to say?

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:45.980
She'd be much better off not getting married, and continuing to do great things in the modeling world.

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:48.330
Is that the truth of it?

00:11:54.210 --> 00:11:56.430
That's how I want it, right?

00:11:56.430 --> 00:11:59.930
I won't have any regrets, really.

00:12:01.020 --> 00:12:03.510
This has gotten really terrible!

00:12:03.510 --> 00:12:07.790
If I don't do something about this catastrophe, I can't call myself the Angel of Love!

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:10.390
But it's not like we can help.

00:12:10.390 --> 00:12:12.430
Don't be faint-hearted!

00:12:12.430 --> 00:12:14.180
We <i>have</i> to do something!

00:12:14.180 --> 00:12:16.160
O-Okay.

00:12:16.160 --> 00:12:17.750
Is this all right?

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:18.850
I dunno.

00:12:24.870 --> 00:12:27.410
Angel of Love: Amulet Angel!

00:12:27.410 --> 00:12:30.770
I'll mend your love!

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:33.520
Why are we stuck doing this?

00:12:36.310 --> 00:12:39.140
El, can you really do that?

00:12:39.140 --> 00:12:41.420
Activating Love Repair Beam!

00:12:41.420 --> 00:12:42.390
What's that?

00:12:42.390 --> 00:12:43.890
Just do it!

00:12:45.390 --> 00:12:49.200
L-Love Repair Beam!

00:12:52.680 --> 00:12:54.330
Hey, what was that?

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:54.850
Huh?

00:13:02.600 --> 00:13:03.930
Ow.

00:13:05.060 --> 00:13:07.310
What were you trying to do?

00:13:07.810 --> 00:13:08.730
Are you okay?

00:13:08.730 --> 00:13:10.500
Yes, I'm fine!

00:13:11.840 --> 00:13:13.680
Might you be Amu-chan?

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:15.470
Huh? Oh, yeah.

00:13:15.470 --> 00:13:20.730
My goodness. Shu-chan's told me all about how cute and stubborn you are.

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:23.060
The "stubborn" part is unnecessary.

00:13:26.920 --> 00:13:27.680
Um...

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:31.430
Are you really not going to get married?

00:13:32.010 --> 00:13:34.010
I'm not good at expressing myself...

00:13:34.010 --> 00:13:37.620
But Shu-niichan's a lot more manly than he looks!

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:39.060
I see.

00:13:39.060 --> 00:13:41.060
You're worried about us.

00:13:43.600 --> 00:13:45.890
We're incompatible.

00:13:46.490 --> 00:13:47.650
I knew it.

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:51.250
An apprentice pâtissier?

00:13:51.250 --> 00:13:53.810
Can he make her happy?

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:57.680
No way. She'd definitely regret marrying him.

00:13:57.680 --> 00:13:59.780
Poor thing.

00:14:09.100 --> 00:14:10.860
Amu-chan,

00:14:10.860 --> 00:14:15.600
can I tell you about the day we first met?

00:14:16.730 --> 00:14:18.310
Back then,

00:14:18.310 --> 00:14:20.600
I was studying abroad in Paris.

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:23.770
I was feeling a little depressed.

00:14:26.140 --> 00:14:31.020
I'd gone to Paris just because I thought it was great{lit: longed for Paris}, but my studies weren't progressing as I thought they would.

00:14:31.020 --> 00:14:34.730
I lost sight of my dream.

00:14:36.720 --> 00:14:39.850
My passion for ballet and piano, which had been strong when I was a child,

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:42.440
had suddenly cooled.

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:47.560
That was when I considered giving up on looking for my dreams entirely.

00:14:50.760 --> 00:14:53.850
After letting it cool, mix in the creamed butter.

00:14:53.850 --> 00:14:56.150
Put it in the oven for twenty minutes, and right after you bring it out-

00:14:56.150 --> 00:14:56.850
Whoa!

00:15:05.580 --> 00:15:08.560
He was a student doing live-in work at a candy store.

00:15:09.280 --> 00:15:11.810
It was unbelievable how hard he worked there.

00:15:13.040 --> 00:15:18.060
Before I knew it, I was always looking forward to seeing him go by.

00:15:20.180 --> 00:15:21.820
Then one day...

00:15:22.970 --> 00:15:24.310
Coming!

00:15:28.270 --> 00:15:29.560
Huh?

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:31.600
I'm sorry, I made a mistake!

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:35.890
I meant to take this project{lit: theme pastry} to my teacher, but he's next door!

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:36.870
Wait!

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:38.920
That smells good.

00:15:38.920 --> 00:15:40.770
Those are freshly-baked chestnut muffins, right?

00:15:42.010 --> 00:15:43.180
Oh, you can tell?

00:15:43.180 --> 00:15:44.410
Yes!

00:15:44.410 --> 00:15:48.940
Well, if you don't mind, would you taste one for me?

00:15:52.370 --> 00:15:54.100
H-Help yourself.

00:16:06.640 --> 00:16:12.020
It has a happy taste.

00:16:12.020 --> 00:16:13.780
It reminds me of falling in love!

00:16:19.140 --> 00:16:23.720
Shu-chan's presence never fails to cheer me up.

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:28.190
Most people's dreams fade when they become adults,

00:16:28.190 --> 00:16:30.160
but Shu-chan is different.

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:32.780
Then Eriko-san, you...

00:16:32.780 --> 00:16:35.810
I'm not uncertain about the wedding.

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:40.190
Amu-chan, we've got trouble!

00:16:40.190 --> 00:16:41.530
I feel a bad presence!

00:16:41.530 --> 00:16:42.140
Huh?

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:43.380
What's wrong?

00:16:43.380 --> 00:16:45.630
Um, excuse me!

00:16:49.060 --> 00:16:50.850
Shu-niichan!

00:16:52.090 --> 00:16:53.720
Impossible!

00:16:54.540 --> 00:16:56.100
No way, an X Egg?

00:16:57.410 --> 00:17:01.390
Sweet, sweet hate!

00:17:01.390 --> 00:17:03.630
Why is there one here?

00:17:03.630 --> 00:17:05.930
It can't be... Is it from Shu-niichan?

00:17:07.280 --> 00:17:09.140
Black Cream!

00:17:09.140 --> 00:17:10.430
Whoa!

00:17:10.430 --> 00:17:11.930
Hey!

00:17:13.310 --> 00:17:15.040
Oh no, the cake!

00:17:15.040 --> 00:17:17.680
Amu-chan, Character Transform with me!

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:21.780
My heart:

00:17:21.780 --> 00:17:22.770
Unlock!

00:18:01.730 --> 00:18:04.420
Character Transformation: Amulet Clover!

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:07.160
Black Cream!

00:18:14.430 --> 00:18:16.790
Eriko has a rosy future.

00:18:16.790 --> 00:18:18.500
She's too good for me!

00:18:19.010 --> 00:18:22.970
Jeez, it's a misunderstanding! You're jumping to conclusions!

00:18:22.970 --> 00:18:25.810
You're always charging at full speed, looking only at your dreams!

00:18:25.810 --> 00:18:29.070
But isn't that why Eriko-san chose you?

00:18:29.810 --> 00:18:31.130
That's why...

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:32.560
That's why I did, too!

00:18:36.970 --> 00:18:38.580
You were my first love!

00:18:38.580 --> 00:18:40.430
I knew it!

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:42.100
You're never honest with yourself.

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:43.700
A-Anyway,

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:45.500
it's bad to turn your own egg into an X Egg!

00:18:50.970 --> 00:18:54.310
Remake Honey!

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:04.810
Thanks, Amu-chan!

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:18.020
All right, now all we have to do is fix the cake.

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:19.940
Amu-chan?

00:19:23.730 --> 00:19:25.840
What was I doing?

00:19:25.840 --> 00:19:27.090
Shu-chan.

00:19:28.120 --> 00:19:29.180
Eriko!

00:19:30.010 --> 00:19:31.860
Listen, Shu-chan, I...

00:19:31.860 --> 00:19:34.670
I've been wavering all this time...

00:19:35.300 --> 00:19:40.220
I couldn't help thinking that since I'm so clumsy and have no cooking experience, I might slow you down.

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:43.150
It's been worrying me, though I couldn't tell you.

00:19:43.640 --> 00:19:45.650
But now I've made up my mind!

00:19:45.650 --> 00:19:48.080
I'm going to learn how to make cakes!

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:50.280
I'll start from the beginning,

00:19:50.280 --> 00:19:53.640
so that someday we can have our own bakery.

00:19:55.390 --> 00:19:56.730
Eriko.

00:19:58.250 --> 00:20:00.080
It might be really hard.

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:01.310
I know.

00:20:01.310 --> 00:20:03.040
It might take years.

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:04.310
I won't give up!

00:20:04.310 --> 00:20:08.990
My dream is to share my life with you!

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:13.560
Thank you, Eriko!

00:20:15.450 --> 00:20:16.660
Wait a second.

00:20:17.770 --> 00:20:19.220
That's...

00:20:19.870 --> 00:20:21.310
Ah!

00:20:21.310 --> 00:20:22.960
The cake!

00:20:22.960 --> 00:20:24.430
Oh dear.

00:20:24.430 --> 00:20:26.450
I-I'll do something!

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:27.430
The two of us...

00:20:27.430 --> 00:20:29.000
No, all three of us!

00:20:30.480 --> 00:20:32.280
H-Hi there.

00:20:32.280 --> 00:20:33.060
Amu-chan.

00:20:33.060 --> 00:20:35.850
Leave the cake baking to me!

00:21:16.350 --> 00:21:18.240
Ami-chan, you're an angel!

00:21:18.240 --> 00:21:19.370
So cute!

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:31.980
Congratulations!

00:21:31.980 --> 00:21:33.720
Be happy.

00:21:33.720 --> 00:21:35.740
It's time for the bouquet toss!

00:21:35.740 --> 00:21:38.620
The one who catches it will be the next bride!

00:21:43.680 --> 00:21:46.250
The next bride will be...

00:21:51.290 --> 00:21:52.370
Me?

00:22:02.580 --> 00:22:03.230
What?!

00:22:03.230 --> 00:22:06.050
Why am I thinking of all these different guys?

00:22:06.050 --> 00:22:07.200
That's our Amu-chan!

00:22:07.200 --> 00:22:08.520
The girl of many loves.

00:22:08.520 --> 00:22:11.240
It's more fun to have more dreams!

00:22:11.240 --> 00:22:14.650
I'm so the worst kind of girl!

00:22:37.620 --> 00:22:40.630
You can't think that there's {kotaenante...}

00:22:40.630 --> 00:22:44.010
an answer out there somewhere, you see. {arutte...}

00:22:44.820 --> 00:22:50.310
Because the only place you'll find it is inside you. {kotaenante...}

00:22:50.310 --> 00:22:52.550
Ain't that cool? {kakkoii...}

00:22:53.270 --> 00:22:57.500
The fact is, all you're truly feeling... {arinomama...}

00:22:57.500 --> 00:22:59.830
Yup, it's love! {yappa...}

00:23:00.490 --> 00:23:05.390
And right now, all those feelings are welling up. {ima no mama...}

00:23:05.390 --> 00:23:09.160
So head toward the sun, give it everything you've got. {sei ippai...}

00:23:09.160 --> 00:23:12.770
Try bustin' through. {butsukete...}

00:23:12.770 --> 00:23:16.140
Face forward, raise your head up high. {maemuite...}

00:23:16.140 --> 00:23:20.050
There's no time to cry. {naiteru...}

00:23:20.050 --> 00:23:23.300
A passionate kiss! This "youthful" kiss! {jounetsu...}

00:23:23.300 --> 00:23:27.300
I love you when you're trying your best, like now.  {ima ganbatteru...}

00:23:27.300 --> 00:23:30.550
The best kiss! This "all-out" kiss! {saiko no...}

00:23:30.550 --> 00:23:34.530
I want to show you these feelings that fill my heart. {mune ippai...}

00:23:34.530 --> 00:23:39.230
I L-O-V-E Y-O-U.

00:23:45.560 --> 00:23:47.710
Today, I'm number one!

00:23:47.710 --> 00:23:48.760
Yay!

00:23:49.960 --> 00:23:52.610
A prince has come to Seiyo Academy!

00:23:52.610 --> 00:23:55.100
Huh? You mean, one that's not Tadase-kun?

00:23:55.100 --> 00:23:56.520
He comes from a far-away land!

00:23:56.520 --> 00:23:58.180
From across the vast sea!

00:23:58.180 --> 00:24:00.170
The Golden Prince!

00:24:00.170 --> 00:24:01.060
He's incredibly beautiful!

00:24:01.060 --> 00:24:02.390
And extremely rich!

00:24:02.390 --> 00:24:05.540
He says he's come to Seiyo Academy to find a bride!

00:24:05.540 --> 00:24:06.360
What?

00:24:06.360 --> 00:24:07.520
Go for it, Amu-chan!

00:24:07.520 --> 00:24:09.680
The ultimate bride!

00:24:09.680 --> 00:24:10.860
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:10.860 --> 00:24:12.590
The Golden Prince! Part One.

00:24:12.590 --> 00:24:15.730
Maybe he's really here to find the Embryo.

00:24:15.730 --> 00:24:18.030
Will it finally be found?

00:24:18.030 --> 00:24:19.600
You think?
